012 \\- Original Chassis Construction</span>\n\n:::\n\n::::\n\n::: {.notes}\n\nBH \n\n:::\n\n# Past 3 Years\n\n:::: {.columns}\n\n::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation7.jpg)\n\n:::\n\n::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation8.jpg)\n\n:::\n\n::::\n\n::: {.notes}\n\nTension tests + pressure tests\u000bMaximum Simulated Moment (200 lb Driver): 600 lb-in \nDesign Goal: 1800 lb-in (C)\n\n\n:::\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n# Shell Eco-Marathon\n\n# Jano Vasquez-Jaffe & Kimaru Boruett\n\n# Shell Eco-Marathon\n\n:::: {.columns}\n\n::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n\n* <span style=\"color:#EDC932\"> _Worldwide Engineering Competition_ </span>  <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"> </span>\n  * <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">WAY less fast and money intensive version of Formula 1</span>\n* <span style=\"color:#EDC932\"> _Multiple Categories_ </span>  <span style=\"color:#EDC932\"> __:__ </span>  <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"> Prototype and Urban</span>\n* <span style=\"color:#EDC932\"> __Different Powertrain Systems: Hydrogen__ </span>  <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">\\, ICE\\-Hybrids\\, & Battery EVs </span>\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation0.png)\n\n:::\n\n::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation1.png)\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation2.png)\n\n:::\n\n::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n\n:::\n\n::::\n\n::: {.notes}\n\nJC\nMotivations for the Project\nWhat is the shell eco-marathon\nInternational competition where students can pool their knowledge and build what they believe is the best or to the limits of their abilities (so much both of us did not know coming into the project)\nEfficiency, sustainability, and engineering competition \n\n\n\n:::\n\n# Prior Vehicles\n\n:::: {.columns}\n\n::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation3.jpg)\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%20Presentation4.jpg)\n\n_2018 Front Suspension_\n\n:::\n\n::: {.column width=\"33%\"}\n\n![](img%5CMid-Semester%